# Two exports: gv_free/1 is a CLAUSE-FREE declaration (a bare name/arity
# export entry -- the accessor tests name it), gv_owned/1 has a clause of its
# own.  An importer may define clauses for NEITHER: gv_owned is refused as a
# clobber, gv_free (since 2026-09-24) as the dropped "vocabulary-implements"
# idiom.  gate_rival.seam is the mutation gate's "a refused load writes
# nothing" pin against gv_owned.
-module(gate_vocab, [gv_free/1, gv_owned(NAME)])
-private([red])

gv_owned(red),
